/target
Cargo.lock
.env*
.claude/
__pycache__/

# Nested cargo target dirs (e.g. per-agent --target-dir runs inside member crates)
**/target/

# Generated TypeScript client (examples/typescript-client, issue #694). The
# types are regenerated from the served OpenAPI document on every run, so they
# are build output, not source.
node_modules/
examples/typescript-client/src/harvest-api.ts

# claude-agent-daemon example runtime state (issue #1493's README). The
# documented "Try it in one minute" walkthrough runs `agentd` from the
# repository root, and its defaults (`agentd.db`, `agentd.sock`, both
# defined in examples/claude-agent-daemon/src) write there. Left unignored,
# following the docs verbatim leaves the checkout dirty with a database that
# — once run against a real key — holds every prompt, tool input, and file
# the agent read. Guarded by
# scripts/check-agentd-runtime-artifacts-ignored.sh.
/agentd.db*
/agentd.sock*
